 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Invite them to walk around the block with you, or stop at interesting window for a few minutes. Keep it short so they don't get bored. Great. He' appreciate the old fashioned walking stick too, if you get one. Then pick one they like and keep the others in the fridge. Then find a sauce they can handle, like lemon pepper, and keep it simple. Stick to basics like a cup of black tea without any fancy additions. They might not handle too much.",
